{# Renders the gift cards in an email body. Shared by the single card email and the order email so the two cannot
   drift apart in what they tell the customer.

   A physical gift card is shipped with its code printed on it, so the email only announces that the card is on its
   way: printing the code here would make the card spendable before it arrives. Merchants who want the digital
   backup anyway turn on setono_sylius_gift_card.delivery.email_physical_cards, and then a physical card is
   presented exactly like a virtual one. GiftCardEmailManager applies the same rule to the PDF attachments, so a
   card whose code is withheld here has no PDF attached either.

   Emails are rendered outside of a request, so every translation takes localeCode explicitly, the way Sylius' own
   email templates do. Without it the translator's current locale wins: the admin's UI locale when a card is resent
   from the admin, the default locale from the CLI or a webhook.

   @var giftCards \Setono\SyliusGiftCardPlugin\Model\GiftCardInterface[] #}
{% set emailPhysicalCards = emailPhysicalCards|default(false) %}
{% set physicalCount = giftCards|filter(giftCard => giftCard.deliveryType.value == 'physical')|length %}
{% set disclosedCount = emailPhysicalCards ? giftCards|length : giftCards|length - physicalCount %}

{% for giftCard in giftCards %}
    {% set disclosed = emailPhysicalCards or giftCard.deliveryType.value != 'physical' %}
    <p>
        {% if disclosed %}
            <strong>{{ giftCard.code|setono_gift_card_format_code }}</strong><br/>
        {% endif %}
        {{ 'setono_sylius_gift_card.email.balance'|trans({}, 'messages', localeCode) }}: {{ giftCard.amount|sylius_format_money(giftCard.currencyCode, localeCode|default('en')) }}
        {% if giftCard.expiresAt is not null %}
            <br/>{{ 'setono_sylius_gift_card.email.valid_until'|trans({}, 'messages', localeCode) }} {{ giftCard.expiresAt|format_date('long', locale=localeCode) }}
        {% endif %}
        {% if giftCard.customMessage is not empty %}
            <br/><em>{{ giftCard.customMessage }}</em>
        {% endif %}
    </p>

    {% if giftCard.deliveryType.value == 'physical' %}
        <p>
            {{ 'setono_sylius_gift_card.email.physical_on_its_way'|trans({}, 'messages', localeCode) }}
            {%- if not disclosed %} {{ 'setono_sylius_gift_card.email.physical_code_on_card'|trans({}, 'messages', localeCode) }}{% endif %}
        </p>
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if disclosedCount > 0 %}
    <p>{{ 'setono_sylius_gift_card.email.pdf_attached'|trans({}, 'messages', localeCode) }}</p>
    <p>{{ 'setono_sylius_gift_card.email.how_to_redeem'|trans({}, 'messages', localeCode) }}</p>
{% endif %}
